# nvidia-smi scenario for mocks/nvidia-smi: <warm|post> <pstate> <core MHz> <mem MHz> <W> <C> <reasons>
# The warm-up sample holds the lowest pstate and the highest clocks; after it the
# values are pstate 2 then 3, core 2400 then 2520, memory 5001 then 4800.
warm P0 3105 9001 120.10 50 0x0
post P2 2400 5001 131.40 56 0x0
post P3 2520 4800 131.40 58 0x0
